THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND ATTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================

ODOOFX is built on top of, and inspired by, several open-source projects:

1. Robot Framework
   - Project: https://robotframework.org/
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Used for: Test automation framework, keyword definition, test execution

2. rf-test-agents
   - Repository: https://github.com/CyrilM29/rf-test-agents
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Author: Cyril Montiel
   - Used for: Agent methodology (planner, generator, healer, istqb, verifier)
     and MCP contract patterns. ODOOFX adapts the universal RF agents for
     Odoo-specific capabilities.

3. SAPFX (SAP test automation)
   - Repository: https://github.com/CyrilM29/robotframework-sapfx
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Author: Cyril Montiel
   - Used for: Project structure, distribution patterns, memory organization,
     CI/CD workflow, and guard mechanics. ODOOFX mirrors SAPFX's design for
     another ERP (Odoo instead of SAP).

4. Playwright
   - Project: https://playwright.dev/
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Used for: Web UI automation via Browser library (Playwright browsers)

5. Robot Framework Browser Library
   - Project: https://github.com/MarketSquare/robotframework-browser
   - License: Apache License 2.0
   - Used for: High-level keywords for web automation

