================================================================================
NO MATERIAL COPIED WHOLESALE
================================================================================

ODOOFX is NOT a fork of SAPFX or rf-test-agents. It is a new project that:
- Adopts the same architectural patterns and methodology
- Targets a different ERP (Odoo instead of SAP)
- Implements domain-specific keywords and agents for Odoo
- Shares the same author and design philosophy

Code was written fresh for Odoo automation. The similarities in structure
reflect best practices established in the SAPFX and rf-test-agents projects.

